---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Moving to Australia from New Zealand | GoAustralia.co.nz" description="Compare removal companies, shipping options and get free quotes for your NZ to Australia move.">

<style is:global>
  .coming-soon-hero {
    background: #0D1117;
    padding: 80px 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }
  .coming-soon-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .coming-soon-hero p {
    font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 32px; line-height: 1.65;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .coming-soon-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(0,105,143,0.15); color: var(--amber);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,105,143,0.3);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .coming-soon-features {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px; margin: 60px auto 0; max-width: 860px; padding: 0 28px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cs-feature {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 22px;
  }
  .cs-feature-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .cs-feature h3 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .cs-feature p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .coming-soon-features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<section class="coming-soon-hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="coming-soon-badge">Coming Soon</div>
    <h1>Moving from New Zealand to Australia</h1>
    <p>Compare removal companies, get shipping quotes, and find everything you need to get your belongings across the Tasman — stress-free.</p>
    <a href="/tools/checklist" class="hdr-cta" style="font-size:15px; padding:13px 32px; display:inline-block;">View Moving Checklist →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="coming-soon-features">
    <div class="cs-feature">
      <div class="cs-feature-icon">🚛</div>
      <h3>Removalist Comparison</h3>
      <p>Compare quotes from Grace, Allied, Crown and more. Get 3 quotes instantly for your NZ → AU move.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-feature">
      <div class="cs-feature-icon">📦</div>
      <h3>Shipping & Containers</h3>
      <p>Half container or full? Air freight? We show you the options and costs for every budget.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-feature">
      <div class="cs-feature-icon">🐾</div>
      <h3>Pet Transport</h3>
      <p>Moving your dog or cat? We compare specialist pet transport companies for the NZ → AU journey.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="cta-band">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>Planning your move now?</h2>
    <p>Use our free 70-step checklist while the Moving Hub is being built.</p>
    <a href="/tools/checklist" class="cta-band-btn">Open the Checklist →</a>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
